===== api secret set =====
Store a secret (hidden prompt, or one line from stdin with --stdin)

Usage:
  api secret set <name> [--for <url>]... [flags]

Flags:
      --for stringArray   a server this secret may be sent to, e.g. https://api.dev.example.com (repeatable)
      --stdin             read the secret from one line of stdin (for scripts; never from an argument)
      --unbind            replace the secret AND remove its server binding

Global Flags:
